            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Lastly, I wrote some amazing ✨ documentation. I spent a lot of time making sure that the docs were accurate and extensive.\nThe docs include a detailed guide on setting both Apple and Google. I also provided an "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 27,
